@baseUrl = http://localhost:9060
@userId = idea-demo-user

### 1. 保存显式偏好
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/memory
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"content":"喜欢历史文化与博物馆"}

### 2. 提交规划（执行后自动保存 taskId / planId）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trip/plan
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotency_key": "beijing-demo-001",
  "city": "北京",
  "start_date": "2026-11-01",
  "end_date": "2026-11-03",
  "travel_days": 3,
  "transportation": "公共交通",
  "accommodation": "经济型酒店",
  "preferences": ["历史文化", "美食"],
  "free_text_input": "不要太赶，最后一天返程",
  "language": "zh"
}

> {%
client.global.set("taskId", response.body.task_id);
client.global.set("planId", response.body.plan_id);
%}

### 3. 查询任务；直到 status 为 completed 再创建聊天
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trip/status/{{taskId}}
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 4. 历史记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trip/history?limit=10
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 5. 读取第一版行程
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trip/plans/{{planId}}/versions/1
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 6. 创建绑定版本的聊天会话
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"plan_id":"{{planId}}", "version_no":1}

> {%
client.global.set("sessionId", response.body.data.session_id);
%}

### 7. 行程问答
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/ask
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"session_id":"{{sessionId}}", "message":"这份行程的预算大约是多少？有哪些需要提前预约？"}

### 8. 聊天消息；后续将 after 换成已收到的最大 sequence_no
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages?after=0&limit=50
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 9. 同一计划生成新版本；相同幂等键和相同内容再次执行会返回原任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trip/plan
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plan_id": "{{planId}}",
  "idempotency_key": "beijing-demo-002",
  "city": "北京",
  "start_date": "2026-11-01",
  "end_date": "2026-11-03",
  "travel_days": 3,
  "transportation": "公共交通",
  "accommodation": "经济型酒店",
  "preferences": ["历史文化"],
  "free_text_input": "减少步行距离",
  "language": "zh"
}

### 10. 查询已完成的版本列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trip/plans/{{planId}}/versions
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### 11. 查看召回偏好
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memory
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
